commit 9108abf4d7c2d6deb8dc9453361af9454cc39340

C03: «escuchando» counts as the playing state and the missing_state hint for a YouTube playback names the state and the title (MUSIC1563)

MUSIC1561 measured seven verified playbacks and six finals naming the observed title in full; two finals were lost because, after a first draft that judged relevance or omitted the title, the retries wrote the bare title and then «Estoy escuchando «…»», which the playback-state check did not read as playing. llm.py admits «escuchando» among the playing forms and the missing_state retry hint for a verified media.play.youtube asks to say it is playing and quote the whole observed title. Registry-wide recogniser diff: no literal changes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


